          '**text-generation-webui is a free, open-source application that both loads and runs a local language model AND provides the chat interface for it — unlike server-fronting tools such as Open WebUI, it is the inference engine itself, not just a client.** It supports several different backend engines so you can choose the format your model is distributed in: GGUF via llama.cpp, EXL3 via ExLlamaV3, full-precision via Transformers, or optimized inference via TensorRT-LLM.',
